    "summary": "Laurent Rousseau, CEO of Global Capital & Advisory, and Europe and IMEA at Marsh Re, said today that the capital markets are “no longer a visitor” but “now a resident” of the reinsurance industry, as investors increasingly allocate to the space. The capital markets are no longer a visitor to our industry; they are now a resident,” he continued. According to Rousseau, going forwards, reinsurance companies that understand how to partner with the capital markets and who make that partnership part of their value proposition, will be the durable competitive advantage.",
