    "summary": "Broker Marsh is aiming to bring alternative sources of insurance and reinsurance capital into the digital infrastructure risk transfer sector, through the launch of a $10 billion property insurance exchange named Stratus. Marsh is clearly seeking to bring alternative and third-party capital in to help fill this gap through this new Stratus insurance exchange. Stratus offers access up to $10 billion in property insurance capacity on a single-placement basis, Marsh explained, with this targeted at the complex operational risks of digital infrastructure projects, including data centers and related critical support systems.",
