    "url": "https://coverager.com/fuse-launches-terminal-bloomberg-for-commercial-insurance/",
    "summary": "New York, NY, August 25, 2026 — Fuse, the AI-powered market intelligence platform for commercial insurance, today announced the general availability of Fuse Terminal , a single-screen professional workspace that brings the entire Fuse platform — and the market it describes — to one keyboard-first surface. Two years in development, Terminal delivers the most real-time view of the commercial insurance market ever surfaced, and the closest thing to a Bloomberg Terminal the industry has ever had: one instrument-level view of the market, a short typeable address for every question, and — for the first time in any market terminal — answers written from the filing record itself. Commercial insurance never had that record — so we spent two years building it, and then we put a terminal on top,” said Sean Bourgeois, Founder &amp; CEO of Fuse.",
